{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id1486405687"}, "name":{"label":"itsshannahh"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-05-13T20:10:22-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.1.6"}, "id":{"label":"12653705628"}, "title":{"label":"Great app but needs a few tweaks!"}, "content":{"label":"Super great for someone like me who needs structure but can’t stick to a plan unless I write it out. Another thing that the developers could improve on is that when you continuously change the icon (for example, a task that I regularly have is walk (dog’s name). The app always suggests a human but I like the paw icon. I always have to manually change it and it gets annoying). Also, it would be great if there was a delete all button if you accidentally copied the wrong day. The amount of time I’ve wasted on individually clicking like 20 tasks because I have fat fingers is absurd 😂. Anyways, overall, this app is great and has really helped me stay organized and improve my productivity I just have a few requests.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
