{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id1110365900"}, "name":{"label":"Ebin_05"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-03-20T03:55:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"12442148713"}, "title":{"label":"Promising App with one critical flaw"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve been using this app for a month now, and it’s been a great experience so far. I love its clean, minimalistic design, and the reminders are incredibly helpful. I’ve tried multiple productivity apps in the past, but this is the only one I’ve consistently used for a full month.\n\nHowever, I have one major criticism. I relied heavily on the Copy Day function, but it was recently removed from my app. While I haven’t paid for the app yet, I definitely would have in the future. Losing this feature has made daily task creation much more tedious, to the point where I sometimes skip using the app altogether. It now feels like more of a struggle, and I find myself less inclined to open it.\n\nI really hope the Copy Day feature gets restored soon—it’s a key part of what made this app so effective for me. If it comes back, I’d be happy to continue using (and potentially subscribing to) the app daily again.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id42853390"}, "name":{"label":"ASVPxSlik"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-03-19T11:53:05-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.1.0"}, "id":{"label":"12439834105"}, "title":{"label":"Saved my mental health"}, "content":{"label":"I pretty much rely on this app. Love the focus mode, tons of great options. This is absolutely the best app when it comes to habit tracking.. I’ve test all the free ones. This one is THE BEST! .. Subscription is worth it (prices are actually respectable). Top 5 used apps on my phone (it’s on my bottom quick bar on home screen)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
