{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id796474155"}, "name":{"label":"um......,,,.."}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-03-18T12:16:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.1.0"}, "id":{"label":"12436126386"}, "title":{"label":"Mental health help"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve had a tough time keeping up with my tasks due to my OCD and depression, and my therapist recommended this app to me. As a student already managing school expenses, I wanted to avoid paying for subscriptions, but they were kind enough to offer me a scholarship. I’m incredibly grateful to the app developers. The app is life changing and has helped me in ways I can’t put into words.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id1765147164"}, "name":{"label":"DiamondDachel"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-03-13T04:01:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.1.0"}, "id":{"label":"12415052146"}, "title":{"label":"God Send For ADHD"}, "content":{"label":"I only have the free version as I cannot afford to purchase the premium version, but I would in a heartbeat if I could. I love how your day is literally structured and easy to read. I give up on a lot of apps due to them missing important features for someone with ADHD but this app seems to be the one that I’ve been long searching for. I am super curious how the AI feature will integrate into the app and I feel like it would help folks like me out so much with our executive dysfunction/ paralysis. Thank you to the creators of this app. I will update my review if I do stick to using it which I don’t see being an issue.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
