{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id1762512937"}, "name":{"label":"Nili.Sa"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-03-05T13:18:36-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.1.0"}, "id":{"label":"12386115132"}, "title":{"label":"Not encouraging!"}, "content":{"label":"Overall, it's a decent app, but it's not very encouraging! After checking everything off, you don't even get a \"well done\" or \"you did great today.\" People need that kind of motivation, especially when their schedule is tight and hard. It’s crucial for those with ADHD, procrastination issues, or anxiety to feel motivated to finish tasks.\n\nAlso, if you spend 40 minutes doing nothing, it shows \"Zzz,\" making you feel guilty and lazy. Who designed this?!\n\nThere's no sense of reward, like you're just expected to get things done like a robot.\n\nEven though I like the organized layout, I don't enjoy using it because it makes me feel rushed and not good enough. No matter how much I get done, I still feel like I'm not good enough, and that's a worse feeling.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id628098596"}, "name":{"label":"SenakyMex"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-03-04T08:29:41-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"12381508882"}, "title":{"label":"A stepping stone that changed my life."}, "content":{"label":"I was sceptical of organization/scheduling apps as most often charge a ridiculous fee or are too scattered and a bore to work with. But after using this for three months, I can say that it has def helped me change my life. \n\nI always have a big to do list, but never have I had one that has helped me use allotted time slots. This for some reason works better for me, and it keeps things visually organized and simple. \n\nThis app along with a small ounce of dedication or “want” to change is all you need. It def helped me build my discipline, which like everything else is a practice. \n\nAlso the new AI feature saves a lot of time, especially if I start my day early or late, I can ask to push my daily schedule back however I need it to etc. \n\nBuying a lifetime membership once my one year is over :)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
